  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-reserva-3-6",
   "n": 6,
   "num": 2,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Esboza el recinto limitado por la gráfica de la parábola \\(y=-(x-2)^2-2\\), la recta tangente a la gráfica de la parábola en el punto de abscisa \\(x=3\\), el semieje positivo de abscisas y el semieje negativo de ordenadas. Calcula su área.",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(f(3)=-1-2=-3\\), \\(f'(x)=-2(x-2)\\Rightarrow f'(3)=-2\\): tangente \\(y+3=-2(x-3)\\iff y=-2x+3\\), que corta al eje \\(OX\\) en \\(x=\\frac32\\).</p><p>La parábola siempre está por debajo del eje (\\(f(x)\\leq-2\\)). El recinto (cuarto cuadrante) está limitado arriba por el eje \\(OX\\) de 0 a \\(\\frac32\\) y por la tangente de \\(\\frac32\\) a 3, abajo por la parábola, y a la izquierda por el eje \\(OY\\):</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 220' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polygon points='60.0,81.1 61.9,81.1 63.7,81.1 65.6,81.1 67.5,81.1 69.4,81.1 71.2,81.1 73.1,81.1 75.0,81.1 76.9,81.1 78.8,81.1 80.6,81.1 82.5,81.1 84.4,81.1 86.3,81.1 88.1,81.1 90.0,81.1 91.9,81.1 93.8,81.1 95.6,81.1 97.5,81.1 99.4,81.1 101.2,81.1 103.1,81.1 105.0,81.1 106.9,81.1 108.7,81.1 110.6,81.1 112.5,81.1 114.4,81.1 116.2,81.1 118.1,81.1 120.0,81.1 121.9,81.1 123.8,81.1 125.6,81.1 127.5,81.1 129.4,81.1 131.2,81.1 133.1,81.1 135.0,81.1 136.9,82.4 138.8,83.7 140.6,85.0 142.5,86.2 144.4,87.5 146.2,88.8 148.1,90.0 150.0,91.3 151.9,92.6 153.8,93.9 155.6,95.1 157.5,96.4 159.4,97.7 161.3,99.0 163.1,100.2 165.0,101.5 166.9,102.8 168.8,104.1 170.6,105.3 172.5,106.6 174.4,107.9 176.2,109.2 178.1,110.4 180.0,111.7 181.9,113.0 183.8,114.2 185.6,115.5 187.5,116.8 189.4,118.1 191.2,119.3 193.1,120.6 195.0,121.9 196.9,123.2 198.8,124.4 200.6,125.7 202.5,127.0 204.4,128.3 206.2,129.5 208.1,130.8 210.0,132.1 210.0,132.1 208.1,130.8 206.2,129.6 204.4,128.5 202.5,127.4 200.6,126.3 198.8,125.3 196.9,124.3 195.0,123.4 193.1,122.5 191.2,121.7 189.4,121.0 187.5,120.2 185.6,119.6 183.8,118.9 181.9,118.3 180.0,117.8 178.1,117.3 176.2,116.9 174.4,116.5 172.5,116.2 170.6,115.9 168.8,115.6 166.9,115.4 165.0,115.3 163.1,115.2 161.3,115.1 159.4,115.1 157.5,115.1 155.6,115.2 153.8,115.4 151.9,115.5 150.0,115.8 148.1,116.1 146.2,116.4 144.4,116.8 142.5,117.2 140.6,117.6 138.8,118.2 136.9,118.7 135.0,119.3 133.1,120.0 131.2,120.7 129.4,121.5 127.5,122.3 125.6,123.1 123.8,124.0 121.9,125.0 120.0,126.0 118.1,127.0 116.2,128.1 114.4,129.2 112.5,130.4 110.6,131.7 108.7,132.9 106.9,134.3 105.0,135.6 103.1,137.1 101.2,138.5 99.4,140.1 97.5,141.6 95.6,143.2 93.8,144.9 91.9,146.6 90.0,148.4 88.1,150.2 86.3,152.0 84.4,153.9 82.5,155.9 80.6,157.9 78.8,159.9 76.9,162.0 75.0,164.2 73.1,166.4 71.2,168.6 69.4,170.9 67.5,173.2 65.6,175.6 63.7,178.0 61.9,180.5 60.0,183.0' fill='#b9a4f5' fill-opacity='.55'/><polyline points='45.0,204.9 48.8,199.0 52.7,193.3 56.5,187.9 60.3,182.6 64.2,177.5 68.0,172.6 71.8,167.9 75.7,163.4 79.5,159.1 83.3,155.0 87.2,151.1 91.0,147.4 94.8,143.9 98.7,140.6 102.5,137.6 106.3,134.7 110.2,132.0 114.0,129.5 117.8,127.2 121.7,125.1 125.5,123.2 129.3,121.5 133.2,120.0 137.0,118.7 140.8,117.6 144.7,116.7 148.5,116.0 152.3,115.5 156.2,115.2 160.0,115.1 163.8,115.2 167.7,115.5 171.5,116.0 175.3,116.7 179.2,117.6 183.0,118.7 186.8,120.0 190.7,121.5 194.5,123.2 198.3,125.1 202.2,127.2 206.0,129.5 209.8,132.0 213.7,134.7 217.5,137.6 221.3,140.6 225.2,143.9 229.0,147.4 232.8,151.1 236.7,155.0 240.5,159.1 244.3,163.4 248.2,167.9 252.0,172.6 255.8,177.5 259.7,182.6 263.5,187.9 267.3,193.3 271.2,199.0 275.0,204.9' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='40.0,16.6 150.0,91.3 260.0,166.0' fill='none' stroke='#f0a30a' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='210.0' cy='132.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='216.0' y='136.1'>(3,−3)</text><circle cx='135.0' cy='81.1' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='129.0' y='73.1'>(3/2,0)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 81.1H294.0M60.0 214.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='110.0' y1='78.1' x2='110.0' y2='84.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='107.0' y='95.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='160.0' y1='78.1' x2='160.0' y2='84.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='157.0' y='95.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='210.0' y1='78.1' x2='210.0' y2='84.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='207.0' y='95.1' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='260.0' y1='78.1' x2='260.0' y2='84.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='257.0' y='95.1' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='57.0' y1='183.0' x2='63.0' y2='183.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='187.0' font-size='10'>-6</text><line x1='57.0' y1='149.1' x2='63.0' y2='149.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='153.1' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='57.0' y1='115.1' x2='63.0' y2='115.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='119.1' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='57.0' y1='47.2' x2='63.0' y2='47.2' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='44.0' y='51.2' font-size='10'>2</text></svg></div><p>Calculo el área entre el eje y la parábola de 0 a 3 y le resto el triángulo entre el eje y la tangente de \\(\\frac32\\) a 3:</p>\\[\\int_0^3\\bigl((x-2)^2+2\\bigr)dx=\\Bigl[\\frac{(x-2)^3}3+2x\\Bigr]_0^3=\\left(\\frac13+6\\right)-\\left(-\\frac83\\right)=9,\\qquad\\text{triángulo}=\\frac{\\frac32\\cdot3}2=\\frac94\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=9-\\dfrac94=\\dfrac{27}4\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
