  {
   "id": "matematicas-2002-reserva-3-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la recta \\(r\\) y el plano \\(\\pi\\) siguientes: \\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x+z-a=0\\\\y-az-1=0\\end{cases}\\), \\(\\pi\\equiv2x-y=b\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Determina \\(a\\) y \\(b\\) sabiendo que \\(r\\) está contenida en \\(\\pi\\).",
     "(1 p.) Halla la ecuación de un plano que contenga \\(r\\) y sea perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Director de \\(r\\): \\((1,0,1)\\times(0,1,-a)=(-1,\\,a,\\,1)\\). Normal de \\(\\pi\\): \\(\\vec n=(2,-1,0)\\).</p><p>Contenida: \\(\\vec d\\perp\\vec n\\): \\(-2-a=0\\iff a=-2\\). Un punto de \\(r\\) (con \\(z=0\\)): \\(x=a=-2\\), \\(y=1\\): \\(R(-2,1,0)\\). Debe estar en \\(\\pi\\): \\(-4-1=b\\iff b=-5\\).</p><div class='res'>\\(a=-2\\), \\(b=-5\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El plano contiene a \\(\\vec d=(-1,-2,1)\\) y a \\(\\vec n=(2,-1,0)\\):</p>\\[\\vec d\\times\\vec n=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&-2&1\\\\2&-1&0\\end{vmatrix}=(1,\\,2,\\,5)\\]<p>Plano \\(x+2y+5z+D=0\\) por \\(R\\): \\(-2+2+D=0\\iff D=0\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":0,\"el\":38,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-1.0,3.0,-1.0],[-3.0,-1.0,1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[-3.0,-1.0,1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"poly\",[[-1.776,1.447,2.0],[-3.224,-1.447,2.0],[-3.224,-1.447,-0.5],[-1.776,1.447,-0.5]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[-3.224,-1.447,-0.5],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[0.393,-1.605,0.564],[0.393,1.206,-0.561],[-3.393,1.467,0.092],[-3.393,-1.344,1.216]],\"rgba(22,163,74,.18)\",\"#16a34a\"],[\"txt\",[-3.393,1.467,0.092],\"π′\",\"#16a34a\",4,0],[\"pt\",[-2,1,0],\"R\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m02r3b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m02r3b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m02r3b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m02r3b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='273.4' y1='218.5' x2='58.5' y2='67.7' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='64.5' y='67.7' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><polygon points='190.0,65.9 34.5,18.0 34.5,123.8 190.0,171.7' fill='#8b5cf6' fill-opacity='.26' stroke='#7c3aed' stroke-width='1.2'/><text 